<file path="src/Blazor.Server.UI/Resources/EmailTemplates/_recoverypassword.cshtml">
<p>@Model.AppName received a request to use email as a recovery email for the account @Model.Email.</p>
  <p>Use this token string to finish resting password:</p>
  <br>
  <p><b>@Model.Token</b></p> 
  <br>
  <p>This token string will expire in 1 hours. </p> 
  <p>If you don't recognize @Model.Email, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
</file>

<file path="src/Blazor.Server.UI/Resources/EmailTemplates/_welcome.cshtml">
<p>Hi @Model.UserName,</p>
  <p>Thank you for signing up for @Model.AppName. We are here to help you get the most out of your trial to show how you and your team can develop smarter and faster.</p>
  <br>
  <p><a href="https://mudblazor-s.dotnet6.cn/">Log in</a> and pick one of the walk-throughs to learn how.</p> 
  <br>
  <p>if you have any question at any time, give us a call at 0800(Freephone). We're here to support you. </p> 
  <p>Welcome to @Model.AppName.</p>
</file>

